"**Extends:** :class:`pybamm.expression_tree.state_vector.StateVectorBase`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/expression_tree/state_vector.py:docstring
#: of pybamm.expression_tree.state_vector.StateVector.diff:1
#: pybamm.expression_tree.state_vector.StateVectorDot.diff:1
msgid ""
"Differentiate a symbol with respect to a variable. For any symbol that can "
"be differentiated, return `1` if differentiating with respect to yourself, "
"`self._diff(variable)` if `variable` is in the expression tree of the "
"symbol, and zero otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/expression_tree/state_vector.py:docstring
#: of pybamm.expression_tree.state_vector.StateVector.diff:6
#: pybamm.expression_tree.state_vector.StateVectorDot.diff:6
msgid "The variable with respect to which to differentiate"
msgstr ""

